<h2 class="section-title">Certification</h2>
<p class="text">I earned my Digital Marketing Certificate from Mentors IT Academy, marking an important achievement in my learning journey. I successfully completed the Advance Digital Marketing (Online) course, strengthening my knowledge and practical skills in digital marketing.</p>
